  "details": "Play any mixcloud link that has a \"HQ\" format available, it'll fail with an unknown error.\n\nyt-dlp returns a formats list instead of a file when attempting to play a \"HQ\" mixcloud link, this can be fixed by appending \"\\?hls-64\" to the end of the yt-dlp -f resolve flags.\n\nyt-dlp still appears to play Youtube links (video and stream) fine with this flag appended.\n\nNote this issue is not present on Quest, it plays \"HQ\" mixcloud links fine.",
